+## 2026-09-29 — `charakter-kompilation-fuer-kohaerenz-protokoll`, 2026-03-31, the Charakter-Kompilation
+
+**Places the Guardians inside AEGIS's entry and states no relation.** The Guardians are listed after „Die Guardians:“ ^[charakter-kompilation-fuer-kohaerenz-protokoll.md:L304] within the section on AEGIS, next to its Primal Directive and its Trennungsprotokoll, with no sentence saying whether they are parts of it. The compilation gives each only a world.
