+## 2026-09-29 — `the-sensory-rulebook-the-body-as-a-measuring-device-in-the-p`, 2025-11-03, the Sensory Rulebook
+
+**LogOS embodies the order AEGIS enforces; the other Guardians are agents or forces of their worlds.** „The Guardian of KW1 is LogOS, an agent embodying the strict, formal logic and unyielding order enforced by AEGIS.“ ^[the-sensory-rulebook-the-body-as-a-measuring-device-in-the-p.md:L19] For KW2 the phrase is „an agent tasked with overseeing the paradoxical domain of memory and emotion“ ^[the-sensory-rulebook-the-body-as-a-measuring-device-in-the-p.md:L39] and for KW3 „the enforcer of security, boundaries, and fear-based control“ ^[the-sensory-rulebook-the-body-as-a-measuring-device-in-the-p.md:L59] — neither says by whom the agent is tasked.
+
+Answers for LogOS as an agent of AEGIS's order and for the others as agents or forces without naming AEGIS; it states no hierarchy between AEGIS and the Guardians of KW2 to KW4.
