+## 2026-09-29 — `ki-prompt-analyse-hard-problem-of-consciousness`, 2026-04-28, the Hard-Problem-Analyse
+
+**Reports thirteen alters in a corpus document it names and eleven as decanonised there.** Its inventory row for the Hard Canon Masterfile says: „13 Alters bilden das System Kael (inkl. Moros/Oblivion).“ ^[ki-prompt-analyse-hard-problem-of-consciousness.md:L28] and „39-Kapitel-Matrix (3 Akte × 13 Alters).“ ^[ki-prompt-analyse-hard-problem-of-consciousness.md:L28] and lists as contradiction: „Dekanonisiert explizit frühere Thriller-Plots, physische Schurken und die 11-Alters-Struktur.“ ^[ki-prompt-analyse-hard-problem-of-consciousness.md:L28] These are its reports of a file it does not contain.
+
